# OurCamp Server settings. After a change: sudo systemctl restart ourcamp-server
# Every flag: /opt/ourcamp/oc-server --help
#
# --host: what friends come by, written into links — this server's domain or public IP.
# Without it: the address of the default route, which on many hostings is a private one.
#
# A domain with a Let's Encrypt certificate (links without a fingerprint, ADR-0042):
#   OURCAMP_ARGS=--host ourcamp.kz --tls-cert /etc/ourcamp/tls/fullchain.pem --tls-key /etc/ourcamp/tls/privkey.pem
# (README.txt: how certbot puts the files there.)
#
# Open to anyone with the address: add --open. Ports other than 7780 / 7881 / 7882:
# --bind 0.0.0.0:PORT, --rtc-tcp-port N, --rtc-udp-port N.
OURCAMP_ARGS=
